@HostAddress = https://localhost:55648

### Auth: Login
# @name login
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@futurekawa.com",
  "password": "TestPass123"
}

### Auth: Get current user (sans token - doit échouer en 401)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/me

### Auth: Get current user (avec token)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Auth: Logout
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout

### Measurements: Déclencher une synchro manuelle
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/measurements/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Measurements: Récupérer toutes les mesures
# @name getMeasurements
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/measurements
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Measurements: Récupérer les mesures du premier warehouse retourné ci-dessus
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/measurements/{{getMeasurements.response.body.$.data[0].warehouseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Measurements: Rejouer la synchro pour vérifier l'idempotence (attendu : "0 persisted, 3 skipped")
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/measurements/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}